      "name": "Delusion Support Project",
      "desc": "Commemorative namecard for the collaboration with KFC.",
      "desc2": "\"I heard they're an incredibly famous brand — we absolutely can't mess this up! B—But why did they pick us in the first place...?\"\n\"You must know, right, Xiao'Yu? Ms. Cecilia mentioned that a few days ago, you...\"\n\"...Oh, I don't really know either! But I heard that once this project's finished, Sunna won't have to worry about lunch money ever again~\"\n\"R—Really? Then that's another fixed group expense we can cut down on!!\"\n\"—Wait, Sunna! Weren't we just saying we should figure out why they picked us first...?\"",
